&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At&amp;nbsp;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Prenuvo&lt;/a&gt;, we are on a mission to flip the paradigm from reactive “sick-care” to proactive health care. Our award-winning whole body scan is fast (under 1 hour), safe (MRI has no ionizing radiation), and non-invasive (no contrast). Our unique integrated stack of optimized hardware, software, and increasingly AI, coupled with the patient-centric experience across our domestic and global clinics, have allowed us to lead the change against “we caught it too late again&quot;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting to the VP, Design &amp;amp; Experience, the Director, Creative will lead Prenuvo’s Creative function and oversee a multidisciplinary team of contributors. This leadership role is responsible for the Creative function as a whole; its people, capabilities, priorities, creative vision, quality, and effectiveness. The Director, Creative will oversee Prenuvo&#39;s creative expression across brand, campaigns, paid media, social, web, content, motion, physical environments, events, partnerships, and emerging experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your role is both directive and integrative. You&#39;ll set the creative vision and quality bar while leading through your team, giving them the clarity, ownership, and autonomy to independently direct programs, disciplines, and bodies of work.&amp;nbsp;You&#39;ll partner closely with Marketing, Growth, Product Design, Clinical, Commercial, CX, and other subject-matter experts to ensure creative work is compelling, accurate, and responsive to the needs of a healthcare environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll combine a strong creative point of view with organizational leadership—building the team and capabilities we need, establishing scalable creative practices, and partnering across the company to turn brand and business strategy into exceptional creative work. This is a fully remote position open to candidates authorized to work in the United States. Occasional travel may be required for team gatherings, productions, events, and other business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;This role does not provide visa sponsorship. Applicants must be legally authorized to work in the United States at the time of hire and must not require employer sponsorship for a work visa (current or future).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Help reshape the world through proactive healthcare while working with cutting-edge technology and high performing teams with deep expertise - join us to make a difference in people’s lives!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vision &amp;amp; creative direction&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own and evolve Prenuvo&#39;s creative expression, translating brand and business strategy into a distinctive experience across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the creative vision, principles, and quality standards that guide the brand design team and its partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior creative direction for major campaigns, launches, partnerships, and brand initiatives while empowering Creative Leads to direct individual programs and bodies of work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the brand remains cohesive while continuing to evolve as Prenuvo, its audiences, and its offerings grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Organizational leadership&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the structure, capabilities, performance, and development of Prenuvo&#39;s Creative function, building a multidisciplinary team capable of supporting the company&#39;s evolving brand and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and develop team members, establishing clear accountability and empowering them to lead their teams and work independently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify capability and talent gaps and determine where to build internally versus leverage agencies, freelancers, and production partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create an environment of high standards, collaboration, accountability, creative ambition, and professional growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Portfolio, priorities, and resources&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own creative portfolio planning and resourcing, partnering with the VP of Design &amp;amp; Experience and cross-functional leaders to prioritize creative investment against the company&#39;s highest-value opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance business demand, team capacity, strategic importance, and creative opportunity when establishing priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the Creative organization has the right talent, partners, processes, and resources to deliver against company priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide visibility into creative priorities, capacity, risks, and tradeoffs to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serving as the senior creative authority to the local brand design and creative team while taking broader direction from the VP, Design and Experience and partnering with leaders across Marketing, Growth, Product, Clinical, Commercial, CX, and other functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives, audience insights, and channel strategies into creative opportunities and direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present and advocate for creative strategy and work with senior and executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product Design where brand and product experiences intersect, creating continuity while maintaining clear ownership between the two functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Creative systems and effectiveness&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish scalable approaches to creative intake, prioritization, briefing, review, production, and delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee agencies, freelancers, production partners, and other external creative resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Marketing and Growth to understand creative performance and translate learnings into stronger creative strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance brand-building and performance objectives, ensuring short-term optimization doesn&#39;t come at the expense of long-term brand equity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities for AI and emerging technologies to improve creative exploration, production, scalability, and efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Remain connected to the work and step directly into creative development when the scale, complexity, or strategic importance of an initiative warrants it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years of experience in creative, brand, design, or related disciplines, including significant creative leadership experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years managing and developing creative teams and senior creative talent, with demonstrated success building high-performing multidisciplinary organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An exceptional portfolio demonstrating brand thinking and creative direction across multiple channels and experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience across brand, digital, web, paid advertising, social, video/motion, and integrated campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with physical or experiential design—including retail, clinics, hospitality, or events—is highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of both brand building and performance marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with portfolio prioritization, resource planning, team building, and organizational development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing agencies, production partners, freelancers, budgets, and complex creative programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills, with the ability to influence senior stakeholders and articulate the thinking behind creative decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with product and UX design and the ability to partner effectively with Product Design leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of contemporary creative tools and emerging AI-enabled creative technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consumer marketing experience in healthcare, HealthTech, MedTech, wellness, or another regulated industry is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Values&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;First: we are &lt;strong&gt;Pioneers&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Transforming healthcare requires divergent thinking, bias for action, disciplined experimentation, and consistent grit and determination to maintain momentum. This journey is as challenging as it is rewarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Second: we are &lt;strong&gt;Platform-Builders&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We’re always building foundations that allow us to achieve tomorrow more than we did today. We never lose sight of what’s ahead – in a mindset of ownership and duty to our mission.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all: we are &lt;strong&gt;Patients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We could all be the next person who walks through our very doors, seeking clarity or peace of mind. We are proud of our impact on our patients’ lives, and we won’t stop till everyone can benefit from our work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An avenue to make a positive impact on people&#39;s lives and their health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We believe in preventative healthcare for everyone, including our team - Prenuvo provides free, whole-body scans to each team member&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Growth opportunities are at the heart of our people journey, we’re doing big things with bright minds - there is no single path to success, it can be shaped along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building strong relationships is at the core of everything we do - our team gets together each week to connect, share, and socialize&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognizing time away to restore is vital to our wellbeing - we have a flexible vacation policy and we will encourage you to use it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prenuvo offers a 401(k) retirement savings plan to eligible employees, allowing team members to make pre-tax contributions toward their retirement. While Prenuvo facilitates access to the plan, the company does not currently offer matching contributions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We offer a comprehensive benefits package including health, dental, vision, including Mental Health coverage, to support you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The base salary for this role ranges from $180,000-$210,000 in local currency, depending upon experience and geographic location&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We are an equal-opportunity employer and value diversity at our company. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, religion, color, national origin, gender, sexual orientation, age, marital status, veteran status, or disability status.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;As part of the hiring process, successful candidates will undergo a background check in compliance to applicable federal, provincial, and state rules.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please be advised that official communication from our recruitment team will only come from our authorized domain [&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://prenuvo.com/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;prenuvo.com&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;]. If you are contacted by a recruiter, please ensure their email address ends with @prenuvo.com. We do not use third-party recruitment services or any other email domains for hiring purposes. If you receive communication that you believe to be fraudulent, please report it immediately to jobs@prenuvo.com.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
